==== SUMMARY (HYP-6132) ====
A-class: #coprime-to-30030 can be 11 at Vmax 5544..27720 << 360360 -> Case-A premise
         is construction-dependent; A3 also blocks [15,31] and defeats descent/peel/
         detuned/pigeonhole -> its looseness certificate must come from q>=32 clearing
         or pair-sum rulers = the un-shrunk anti-concentration core.
B-class: exact M vs scale printed above -- plateau refutes 'min M grows with diameter'
         (growth was a sampling artifact of narrow-band constructions; near-dilates pin
         min M near the detuned-dispatch floor at EVERY scale). Looseness itself survives.
